OL,3,GNEWSARoad safety warning ahead of Tour
OL,4,Aof Britain
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are being urged to take extra
OL,7,Fcare on Lincolnshire's roads as the
OL,8,FTour of Britain comes to the county.
OL,10,FStage one of the race will start and
OL,11,Ffinish in Lincoln on 2 September, while
OL,12,Fthe following day cyclists will compete
OL,13,Fon a route between Boston and Skegness.
OL,15,FSimon Outen-Coe, communications manager
OL,16,Fat the Lincolnshire Road Safety
OL,17,FPartnership, said the event could
OL,18,Finspire more people to take up cycling
OL,19,Fand attract riders from outside the
OL,20,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
